# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: The opponent casts Fact or Fiction, and the player separates the revealed cards into two piles.
# Forcing: Fact or Fiction is the AI's only spell and its four Islands pay for it in its main phase.
# AI behavior: The AI casts Fact or Fiction, then chooses one of the player's piles.
# Failure modes:
#   PASS = the player is asked to split the five revealed cards, and the AI's hand gains exactly one of those piles.
#   FAIL = no pile request reaches the player and the AI takes all five cards.
# Card roles:
#   Fact or Fiction — the pile effect under test.
#   Lightning Bolt, Counterspell, Negate, Brainstorm, Ponder — the five revealed cards.
